ig_syntax:
```
// Aliases (none needed)

// Sequence: medication_schedule_triggers_reminder → robot_greets_and_prompts @within(10s)
medication_schedule_triggers_reminder → robot_greets_and_prompts @within(10s)

// Conditional: robot_greets_and_prompts during (patient does not respond within 8 seconds) → patient_responds @within(8s)
// Repair: repair(site=care_facility, max_retries=2) with robot_retries_prompt
robot_greets_and_prompts during (patient does not respond within 8 seconds) → patient_responds @within(8s) repair(site=care_facility, max_retries=2)

// Sequence: patient_responds → robot_confirms_receipt @within(1s)
patient_responds → robot_confirms_receipt @within(1s)

// Failure: failure(site=care_facility) if (patient does not respond after two retry attempts)
failure(site=care_facility) if (patient does not respond after two retry attempts)

// Failure: failure(site=care_facility) if (robot fails to provide confirmation after receiving an acknowledgement)
failure(site=care_facility) if (robot fails to provide confirmation after receiving an acknowledgement)

// Failure: failure(site=care_facility) if (timing constraints are violated) @within(30s)
failure(site=care_facility) if (timing constraints are violated) @within(30s)

// Repair: patient_responds → robot_requests_clarification repair(site=care_facility, max_retries=1) if (patient provides an unclear response)
patient_responds → robot_requests_clarification repair(site=care_facility, max_retries=1) if (patient provides an unclear response)
```
